@startuml EcoChain_AI_Technical_Sequence
autonumber
actor "Rumah Tangga" as User
participant "Next.js Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Next.js API (/api/scan)" as ScanAPI
participant "Google Gemini 2.5 Flash" as Gemini
participant "Supabase PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "EcoRoute Engine (/api/pickup)" as PickupAPI
actor "Pemulung Mitra" as Pemulung
participant "EcoVault Escrow (Midtrans)" as Escrow
participant "EcoTrack AI" as EcoTrack

== 1. Identifikasi & Scanning Limbah (EcoScan AI) ==
User -> Frontend: Upload Foto Sampah/E-Waste
Frontend -> ScanAPI: POST /api/scan (FormData: image, user_id)
ScanAPI -> DB: SELECT * FROM waste_categories
DB --> ScanAPI: Katalog Kategori Limbah
ScanAPI -> Gemini: generateContent(Prompt + Base64 Image)
activate Gemini
Gemini --> ScanAPI: JSON {category_name, estimated_weight_kg, confidence, reasoning}
deactivate Gemini

alt Confidence < 50% atau Gemini Key Error
    ScanAPI -> ScanAPI: Jalankan Smart Heuristic Fallback
end

ScanAPI -> DB: INSERT INTO scan_results
DB --> ScanAPI: scan_id
ScanAPI --> Frontend: Response JSON (Category, Estimated Price, Reasoning)
Frontend --> User: Tampilkan Estimasi Harga (Rp) & Detail Scan

== 2. Penjemputan On-Demand (EcoRoute Multi-Tier Dispatch) ==
User -> Frontend: Klik "Minta Penjemputan On-Demand"
Frontend -> PickupAPI: POST /api/pickup (latitude, longitude, preferred_time)
PickupAPI -> PickupAPI: Hitung Haversine Distance
PickupAPI -> DB: INSERT INTO pickup_requests (status: searching, fallback_tier: 1)
PickupAPI --> Pemulung: Broadcast Notification (Tier 1: Radius <= 2km)

alt Pemulung Terima Order
    Pemulung -> PickupAPI: PATCH /api/pickup (action: accept)
    PickupAPI -> DB: UPDATE status = 'assigned'
    PickupAPI --> Frontend: Status Updated ('assigned')
else Timeout 5 Menit / Pemulung Tidak Ada
    PickupAPI -> PickupAPI: Eskalasi ke Fallback Tier 2 (Radius <= 5km) / Tier 3 (3PL)
end

== 3. Transaksi B2B & ESG Impact (EcoVault & EcoTrack) ==
Pemulung -> User: Penjemputan & Bayar Tunai/E-Wallet
Pemulung -> DB: Update Status 'completed'
DB -> Escrow: Lock Escrow Order B2B ke Pabrik Daur Ulang
Escrow --> DB: Status Escrow 'LOCKED'
DB -> EcoTrack: Trigger Kalkulasi LCA CO2e Saved
activate EcoTrack
EcoTrack -> DB: INSERT INTO impact_logs (co2e_kg_saved, tonnage)
deactivate EcoTrack
Escrow --> Pemulung: Release Escrow Payment (Pabrik Verifikasi Valid)

@enduml
